  dialoguelist:
  - Once upon a time, there were two great magicians, who were also good friends.
  - 'They explored the world all around together... '
  - Until they decided to look for the Ultimate Magic, one that would transcend all
    creations that were made before it...
  - 'And one day, they successfully infused magic into a special device. '
  - 'They called it a "computer." It was as if a new world had begun. '
  - 'Until one of the great magicians vanished. '
